{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0b3a056311e989daf947b7caa3cd1ae1682fc22615e5ce23a6e55cd99b3fe7ff"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Snapshots store a sanitized copy of an earlier file for later comparison without modifying originals, and are learning references rather than full backups."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2a38d9559b3b741bdaa06e734f7b3221b43cd041c00fc473e36c192379427a0a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Learning history and review records are stored under .ahadiff/ in each working folder; API keys go into a scope-specific .env with an environment-variable reference in config.toml."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3c7c4ad2b5103bf40b8561d79c921f82bb03942894df8d4eaf13a14f5c6e6b32"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Provider classes include openai, openai_responses, gemini, anthropic, azure, newapi, openai_compat, lmstudio, and ollama, covering local and remote LLM endpoints."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4ed23ddcbc03f3f6c674e8e600f5b5dd2f593266340e9f57e257c7bfd3a5c3be"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"ahadiff serve creates local state and opens a WebUI at http://127.0.0.1:8765, with a --no-browser option; ordinary folders work while init and doctor target Git repositories."},{"claim_ids":["clm_77d6678623dd8b141f1382865910a300ba1b915fa8ed1189178c45413c446bed"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The WebUI supports five learning sources: Git changes, two files, a pasted diff, a saved snapshot, or a single Markdown document, with local preview before a generation request."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9d921746b939c8d1966037af9b50f7e5cefe63e1c2bd32cbfee085b678aa89f8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: building from source requires cloning the repo, running 'uv sync --locked --dev', and building the viewer with pnpm before an editable uv tool install."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a10df509f6f6fcb6df4aee8bb732524ce867ff7cfb08f75ab02f5a64fec1493c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool does not execute exercise or notebook code; practice statistics reflect recorded attempts and self-assessments, not measured learning gain."},{"claim_ids":["clm_aac25ea095e6a57f610dc7d102acaf65b600ee144660cf12e1d1ed226bc57422"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Default privacy mode is strict_local; redacted_remote or explicit_remote must be chosen before remote providers, and the tool checks for secrets and suspicious instructions while advising user inspection."},{"claim_ids":["clm_abc8b65115441dd9d047a6433a1e36944cbf6cbe32ade01160de710671af6703"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documented limits: no PDF ingestion or web-page capture; directory comparison and Git hooks require macOS/Linux; browser-selected files capped at 256 KiB each (512 KiB per pair) and pasted diffs at 64 KiB."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c9d11cfdbd4a4b0abbd50ab2e04c973f977c85a9bca96ebb8d0ef573ee24adc0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Deterministic scoring covers eight dimensions with required evidence and safety checks; an optional LLM judge gives feedback but cannot override the final verdict."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cb7e292e59de524ca91d765fdb90dcd08d4d004e75dc95cff20ced5ce7c01352"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A read-only MCP server can be registered with tools like Claude or Codex via 'ahadiff mcp-server --repo-root /path/to/workspace'."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ce97dfe7885cb2c9f63e4f0a44f317884a99bc12761d61973c35326daf48b9f8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Installable via pipx or uv tool; an optional 'optimizer' extra adds torch for FSRS parameter optimization, which base review and scheduling do not need."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0b3a056311e989daf947b7caa3cd1ae1682fc22615e5ce23a6e55cd99b3fe7ff","clm_2a38d9559b3b741bdaa06e734f7b3221b43cd041c00fc473e36c192379427a0a","clm_3c7c4ad2b5103bf40b8561d79c921f82bb03942894df8d4eaf13a14f5c6e6b32","clm_4ed23ddcbc03f3f6c674e8e600f5b5dd2f593266340e9f57e257c7bfd3a5c3be","clm_77d6678623dd8b141f1382865910a300ba1b915fa8ed1189178c45413c446bed","clm_9d921746b939c8d1966037af9b50f7e5cefe63e1c2bd32cbfee085b678aa89f8","clm_a10df509f6f6fcb6df4aee8b